{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac297f1ce9c344df8a3b75b6ef87d711","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5c7c8f3ec6818cbc6b89ce396933848b7eb757f9c44c255c328a970671f7edda","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"prorise-cool/claude-code-multi-agent@0dc13057c17f snapshot f6186454c59968b4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7ab9e1dab3b9b1df8b6436981a388002749dba4bd2bd8aabfc5c412f08450d47"],"source_ids":["src_2eafaa34153e5fe5a252b19dff81cd61"],"text":"The layout includes .claude/hooks (core modules base_hook.py, ollama_client.py, document_manager.py, config.py, logger.py plus handler entry scripts), .claude/commands, .claude/skills, and settings.json for hooks configuration.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac297f1ce9c344df8a3b75b6ef87d711"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac297f1ce9c344df8a3b75b6ef87d711","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6599a10518aad93da85dea7b59e11afc926d2a4370309761667d8205d2cbb09f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"prorise-cool/claude-code-multi-agent@0dc13057c17f snapshot f6186454c59968b4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1a19e27a14437dfc0630b5d8f3e5fb35e208b98c7a7125fb8af381831fc7b5dc","slc_77a198b96cb3b7c6848f1708d34e068faaa6d3b7cb0526701ae7d20b372c448e","slc_c32ebebf1590ab0c62670da5fb49e669ac179a3cd4b47cdf7f287105e451b8f3","slc_cee42cb91c44354fa85bb2ee20bfb674f4268a11802eb4adfe7f26d2700d335e","slc_d9fe4c7c12578ff776dfa3008fb566a427a202402a9f139bec2084b21716936f","slc_e0d28b522a450f4ee48dfdabf719ffc94973840694e56526a63e140b15269cf3","slc_fabfc7a069952ad7d301dc3207c059c72251c3c8a79ac05c3a432ccbb4dee7d0"],"source_ids":["src_2eafaa34153e5fe5a252b19dff81cd61"],"text":"The project depends on Ollama (recommended, with gemma3:1b as the suggested lightweight model and llama3.2:3b optional) and uv for Python dependency management, with optional TTS via pyttsx3 configured through environment variables.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac297f1ce9c344df8a3b75b6ef87d711"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac297f1ce9c344df8a3b75b6ef87d711","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6cf669def3ea9f68db4d73af4a2031b9795c595e0b1d114ae5e71d65c0f8d327","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"prorise-cool/claude-code-multi-agent@0dc13057c17f snapshot f6186454c59968b4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8f470622a23446b99ac803e60e225f2a1b8a09a88d626cb851fe3d8cdee88dfa","slc_930fb85e628fc0b83d51cacda6350fa2c31de1fbb10fe37ad06d387631667d06"],"source_ids":["src_2eafaa34153e5fe5a252b19dff81cd61"],"text":"All prompt templates are stored in .claude/hooks/prompts.json with variable placeholders, grouped by hook type, for tuning and version control; edits load on the next hook run without restart.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac297f1ce9c344df8a3b75b6ef87d711"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac297f1ce9c344df8a3b75b6ef87d711","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_724dcb027f0f353fe8e8236012ec42498193e55d23408d7882dde2b60af9a8dc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"prorise-cool/claude-code-multi-agent@0dc13057c17f snapshot f6186454c59968b4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_976600c6d6e913a9e7caa53d772e0a01442ad6a9e4c40c0bb26bc828542f36a8"],"source_ids":["src_2eafaa34153e5fe5a252b19dff81cd61"],"text":"The shipped settings.json grants permissions for Bash(mkdir:*), Bash(uv:*), Bash(chmod:*), Write, and Edit, and wires SessionStart, UserPromptSubmit, and PostToolUse hooks to uv-run Python scripts.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac297f1ce9c344df8a3b75b6ef87d711"}
